{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ODDCORE</strong> is a first person, retro-inspired boomer shooter with roguelike ingredients that is packed with endless, brain-rotting visuals of your bullets exploding everything they touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">fast-paced first person combat experience with retro liminal aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique weapons and 8 different gadgets for a combination of 112 unique loadouts\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 battle arenas, 4 nightmare variants, and 17 secret variants to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 weird enemy types + 2 unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An arcade with classic mini games to win prizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">sandbox editor for custom levels (experimental)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ENDLESS replay-ability with tons of random upgrades that makes no two runs the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">leaderboards to keep tab of our best runners of course :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FOR NOW, IF THE ODDCORE IS CALLING YOUR NAME\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> please read the letter below, thank you\u00a0</strong>\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To YOU, YES YOU</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, looks like you are chosen to be His janitor! Here is the run down of the job:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You are now an ODDCORE runner AND you have been employed to clean up our park one variant at a time in preparation for the coming holiday season. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deploy each run with new loadouts, manage time wisely and eradicate the corrupted hordes from taking over the ODDCORE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/extras/Equip.gif?t=1745280867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>EQUIP YOURSELF FOR DEPLOYMENT</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the ODDCORE with your own load-out, combining a variety of weapons and gadgets. Prove yourself to be the best among us.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/extras/Era.gif?t=1745280867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ERADICATE CORRUPTED ENTITIES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Preserving our memories one kill at a time. A bullet a day keeps the ODD away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/extras/Eject.gif?t=1745280867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>EJECT INTO NEW VARIANTS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Somebody's gotta do the job! BEWARE, some variants can get odd...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/extras/Escape.gif?t=1745280867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ESCAPE?!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just kidding, you can take breaks though........ okay that's 10 seconds, GET BACK TO WORK!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May the ODDCORE find favor upon you! Try doing a better job than the last guy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sincerely,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ODDBALL ODDIE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Warning!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing effects that may be unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Apply a Sticker to a Weapon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/a6a7f6e6a81683f15fb136bdb0a9ae5666faf5b7.jpg"},{"name":"You\u2019re the Conductor!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/11c97fa975dba81cccb260cbffb9060de4e9f79e.jpg"},{"name":"A Safe Place?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/2ca0e9223d7b711c75105b374a2340223730f7d3.jpg"},{"name":"DEMO RUNNERS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/9b40389ca88dca8412a6700ffd2f894d9a439321.jpg"},{"name":"bro chill, it's just a demo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/c7c2b36616bb8423f96083e2caf9b7421d62cfe7.jpg"},{"name":"Survive the Watcher\u2019s Realm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/f85d57110bbd9c4dea9ec990eb41da231e12bada.jpg"},{"name":"Maybe a Gambling Problem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/e43ca11b9890130cb5ab912f9dd1b46e1e3bff15.jpg"},{"name":"Cleanup Crew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/c3b044efab09bbba26f8fc97165a6515a1951b25.jpg"},{"name":"Huh?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/f795f8aa4e14d92f32a147d61ef5b274953daad4.jpg"},{"name":"Heal Yourself Using a Soul","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420190/2bad14c85502040620356e29e1085d88a53a6cc1.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420190?t=1745280867","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745280867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/38a179b236e05d0c154a0bfd4fb688ee41e0d462/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745280867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/38a179b236e05d0c154a0bfd4fb688ee41e0d462/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745280867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/extras/DISCORD_PNG.png?t=1745280867\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ODDCORE</strong> is a first person, retro-inspired boomer shooter with roguelike ingredients that is packed with endless, brain-rotting visuals of your bullets exploding everything they touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">fast-paced first person combat experience with retro liminal aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 unique weapons and 8 different gadgets for a combination of 112 unique loadouts\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 battle arenas, 4 nightmare variants, and 17 secret variants to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 weird enemy types + 2 unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An arcade with classic mini games to win prizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">sandbox editor for custom levels (experimental)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ENDLESS replay-ability with tons of random upgrades that makes no two runs the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">leaderboards to keep tab of our best runners of course :)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FOR NOW, IF THE ODDCORE IS CALLING YOUR NAME\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> please read the letter below, thank you\u00a0</strong>\u2193</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To YOU, YES YOU</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, looks like you are chosen to be His janitor! Here is the run down of the job:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You are now an ODDCORE runner AND you have been employed to clean up our park one variant at a time in preparation for the coming holiday season. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deploy each run with new loadouts, manage time wisely and eradicate the corrupted hordes from taking over the ODDCORE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/extras/Equip.gif?t=1745280867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>EQUIP YOURSELF FOR DEPLOYMENT</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the ODDCORE with your own load-out, combining a variety of weapons and gadgets. Prove yourself to be the best among us.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/extras/Era.gif?t=1745280867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ERADICATE CORRUPTED ENTITIES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Preserving our memories one kill at a time. A bullet a day keeps the ODD away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/extras/Eject.gif?t=1745280867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>EJECT INTO NEW VARIANTS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Somebody's gotta do the job! BEWARE, some variants can get odd...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/extras/Escape.gif?t=1745280867\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ESCAPE?!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just kidding, you can take breaks though........ okay that's 10 seconds, GET BACK TO WORK!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May the ODDCORE find favor upon you! Try doing a better job than the last guy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sincerely,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ODDBALL ODDIE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Warning!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing effects that may be unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</p>","developers":["Scarecrow Arts"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2896260","name":"ODDCORE"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420190/header.jpg?t=1745280867","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257086531,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086531/movie480.mp4?t=1736981435","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257086531/movie_max.mp4?t=1736981435"},"name":"ODDCORE - Demo Out Now!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257086531/a14744a1d9ed49f0d267df1c5a74247e1338a276/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1736981435"